---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/40 p-8 md:p-14 text-center md:text-left mb-10">
      <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sm text-white/60 mb-4">
        About
      </p>

      <h1 class="text-4xl mb-6">Hi, I'm Christopher</h1>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[auto,1fr] gap-8 items-start mb-8">
        <div class="w-40 h-40 sm:w-48 sm:h-48 rounded-2xl border border-white/25 overflow-hidden mx-auto sm:mx-0 shrink-0">
          <img
            src="/images/headshot.jpg"
            alt="Christopher Noblett"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
            <!-- TODO: replace with your own words -->
            I'm a Dublin-based developer finishing a Computer Science degree at TU Dublin.
            Outside of client work I've built everything from Android apps to machine learning
            models, and I genuinely enjoy the problem-solving side of building software as much
            as the design side.
          </p>
          <p>
            When I'm not building websites, you'll usually find me [add a hobby/interest or two here].
            I started freelancing because I wanted to help small businesses get the kind of website
            that's usually reserved for people with agency budgets.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      
        href="/christopher-noblett-cv.pdf"
        download
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-white/60 px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition font-medium mb-10"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3v12m0 0-4-4m4 4 4-4M4 21h16"/></svg>
        Download CV
      </a>

      <hr class="border-white/15 mb-10" />

      <div class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed space-y-4 md:columns-2 md:gap-10">
        <p>
          I build custom websites for clinics, tradespeople, local businesses and small brands who
          deserve a proper online presence without having to pay agency prices for it. I'm based in
          Dublin, and I work with clients everywhere.
        </p>

        <p>
          Loads of people can build a website. The real advantage here is being able to build
          something genuinely custom, designed specifically around your business, your customers
          and how you actually work, without the overheads that come with a big agency.
        </p>

        <p>
          Every project starts with understanding your business first: what you do, who your
          customers are, and what you need the site to actually achieve, whether that's more
          calls, more bookings, or simply looking credible when someone searches for you.
        </p>

        <p>
          From there, every site is built by hand rather than assembled from a generic template,
          so it looks and feels like it belongs to your business, not like it was picked off a shelf.
        </p>

        <p>
          The goal is simple: an affordable, professional website, built properly, delivered fast,
          and backed up with ongoing support if you need it.
        </p>

        <p>
          Custom Design • Mobile Responsive • Fast Turnaround • Local &amp; Affordable
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 sm:gap-10 mb-10">
      <div class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-96 rounded-2xl border border-white/25 overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="/images/studio2.jpeg"
          alt="Working on a website design"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="h-64 sm:h-80 md:h-96 rounded-2xl border border-white/25 overflow-hidden">
        <img
          src="/images/studio3.jpeg"
          alt="Laptop showing website code"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white text-brand-500">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-center">
      <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sm text-brand-500/70 mb-4">
        The Promise
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-8">
        Custom-built, not templated
      </h2>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-left max-w-xl mx-auto">
        <div class="border border-brand-500/25 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-brand-500/85">
            A completely customised website designed around your business, not a one-size-fits-all
            template.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-brand-500/25 rounded-xl p-5">
          <p class="text-brand-500/85">
            Affordable pricing built for growing businesses, with no hidden extras.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
